{"id":"STev_01_03","names":{"0":"","avg1_155":"Shia","avg1_157":"Karin","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_201":"Marlene"},"en":{"0":"","avg1_155":"Shia","avg1_157":"Karin","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_201":"Marlene"},"tx":1,"steps":[["intro","Act Three","Mysteries and Scents","You learn about Shia and Karin's purpose for this journey: They seek to clear their grandmother's name. For some reason, Shia is unusually affectionate toward you…"],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","cabin_night",0,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_155","b","012",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,"sigh",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_155","Thirteen years ago, a mysterious light appeared over the sea, plunging the whole town into panic—people thought it was a sign, an omen of some coming disaster.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_055"],["say","avg1_155","Granny was the best seafaring Trekker around, so with a brand-new ship and the town's hopes behind her, she sailed out to learn the truth.",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_369"],["say","avg1_155","Three days and nights she sailed ... and she finally reached it.",0,""],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["bg","view_wasteland_night",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",3.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m29"],["trn",0,0,false,false,1],["w",1],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["fx",5,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["bg","beach_shipwreck_night",5,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["cbg",5,200.0,-350.0,1.4,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stage",5,0,0],["cbg",5,150.0,null,null,"Linear",2.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_155","—But it wasn't just light. It was a massive Ghost Ship, glowing in the dead of night.",0,""],["w",1.0],["show","avg3_201","a","004",0.45,null,null,5,null,0.0],["se","se_075"],["ctl","avg3_201","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_201","...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_201","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_201","So the legends... They're true.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_369_stop"],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["stage",5,1,3],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["bg","cabin_night",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_155","b","016",0.5,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,"speechless",0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","Granny was gone for almost two weeks. Everyone thought we'd lost her.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"v","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","What happened next?",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","017","vexation",null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","Then one morning, someone found her passed out on the beach. She'd made it back in a tiny, rickety rowboat.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_155","b","011",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","She was covered in bandages, clothes in shreds, worn down to nothing... I was scared stiff when I saw her.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_155","b","014","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","When she woke up, she told us what happened.",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg3_201","b","007",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_201","b",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_201","Never ...==W== ever ... go near those waters.",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_368"],["ctl","avg3_201","b","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_201","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_201","Once you're in the Ghost Ship's territory, there's no escape.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_201","b","007",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_201","The ghosts ... they crawl onto your ship when you're not looking, choke you, and claw at your skin ... anything to drag you under.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_201","b","005",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_201","I tried to fight them off with a weapon, but my effort was to no avail. I had to abandon my ship...==W== If it wasn't for that spare boat... I'd just be another ghost aboard it now.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_201","b","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["bg","cabin_night",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"v","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Ghost Ship... So it's actually real? I thought it was just a myth.",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["show","avg1_157","b","002",0.45,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_157","b",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","The sea's full of things you wouldn't believe.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_157","b","010","star",null,null,null,1.0,"JuGong1","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","That's what makes it so enticing!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m46"],["mrt",1,"v","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","But if you know it's the Ghost Ship, why risk heading back out there?",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,-60.0,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_157","b","002",null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["w",0.3],["show","avg1_155","b","009",0.65,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,"speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",1.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b",null,null,0.3,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["se","se_075"],["ctl","avg1_155","b","005",null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","Because some people in town don't believe what Granny said.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_155","b","014",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","They think the light is some huge sunken treasure.",0,""],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg1_155","b","012",null,null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","And that the Ghost Ship was just a story she made up to keep the treasure for herself...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"u","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","No wonder some folks just laughed at us when we asked about the Ghost Ship.",2,""],["mrt",0,"u","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I'm afraid they think it's just a hoax.",2,""],["mrt",3,"u",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","017",null,null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","Since then, the light has appeared every few years. Whether it's a coincidence or not, it always shows up after continuous summer downpours. And since that's when storms are most frequent, no one dares to go out to sea.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_155","b","016","sigh",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","But it stopped appearing a few years ago ... right around when Granny passed away.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","012",null,null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","So people started this awful rumor that the light vanished 'cause Granny took all the treasure before she died.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","013","angry",0.35,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","She was trying to protect everyone, and they call her a liar... It's so messed up.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","002","attention",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","But after that big storm a few days back, the light finally returned. This is our chance. We have to find that Ghost Ship.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"v","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Oh, I get it now. You're doing this to clear your grandmother's name, right?",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.3],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_157","b","014","resentful",0.5,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","Exactly. And the jerks spreading those lies? They hired their own Trekkers and are bragging they'll \"find the treasure within a week.\"",0,""],["se","se_251"],["ctl","avg1_157","b","013",null,null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","...==W== A big storm should just get rid of 'em. Right?",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_157","b","007","angry",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"u","025","symbol",null],["say","avg3_100","Did she just say what I think she said...? No, I must've misheard...",2,""],["mrt",3,"u",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_230"],["bg","mood_5",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","022",null,null,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","Right? Right? Right? Right? Right? Right? Right?! RIGHT?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["mrt",1,"u","007","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","Okay, that is terrifying!!",2,""],["mrt",3,"u",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","cabin_night",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_155","b","014",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,"sigh",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","Granny never cared about the rumors, but I can't stand people trashing her name.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","017","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",1.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","009",null,null,null,null,1.0,"JuGong1","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","... And yeah, I need to solve the mystery she left behind.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"u","020","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","A mystery? So her grandma was hiding another secret?",2,""],["mrt",3,"u",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m49"],["stg",0,60.0,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["show","avg1_157","b","002",0.25,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_157","b","010","star",0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","You bet! A stupid ghost ship doesn't scare us!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,0.78,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.3],["ctl","avg1_157","b","012","happy",0.45,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","Besides, we even got a special camera from the Trekker Association to catch those ghosts on film!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"v","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Hmm, if you actually got a shot of the Ghost Ship...",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","015","exclamation",null,-0.35,1.5,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.3],["say","avg1_157","—We can take cursed photos! ==W==That'll curse all the jerks who bad-mouthed Grandma! For generations! Right?!",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_157","b","020","resentful",null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.2],["bg","mood_4",0,0.3],["w",0.3],["mrt",1,"u","007","awkward",null],["say","avg3_100","C-Curse...? Okay, definitely didn't mishear that...",2,""],["mrt",0,"u","009","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Anyway, we're after the same thing.",2,""],["mrt",0,"u","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Wonder if they'd let me join...",2,""],["mrt",3,"u",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","cabin_night",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_155","b","004",0.65,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_157","b","002",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["se","se_062"],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"v","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Ahem. Got a proposal for you two.",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","009","question",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","A proposal?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","004",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","What is it? Out with it.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"v","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Since we're all here investigating the light, mind if I tag along?",1,""],["mrt",0,"v","013","music",null],["say","avg3_100","I can't swim or sail, but I'm quick on my feet, and I can pull my weight. Another pair of hands, right?",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","003","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","Hmm...==W== What do you think, Shia?",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_157","b","017",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","004",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","Sounds good, but what if ==SEX=='s actually a bad person?",0,""],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg1_157","b","006",null,null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_157","Like, ==SEX== could finish our food when we're asleep ... or worse, mess with the rudder!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","004","happy",0.6,null,null,1.0,"JuGong1","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","Hehe, don't you worry, Karin~♪ Boss isn't a bad person.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"v","015","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Oh? You're sure?",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","006","music",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_155","Hehe, just a feeling.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"u","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Does she have some kind of special ability...?",2,""],["mrt",3,"u",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_061"],["ctl","avg1_155","b","004",null,null,null,null,1.0,"zuochupen